  "notes": "Hold-to-build games play much better: Falcor sees when a hold misses, works out too short or too long, starts with short holds and remembers what worked. Your own tips for a game are kept and followed on every move. Building with a game's own coins is allowed (never real money or gems), and moving screens no longer throw away Falcor AI's plans.",
